        <div id="questions-7685553" data-guid="7685553" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="7685553_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">This article shall take effect immediately upon final passage and signature into law.<a class="footnoteref" href="#ft7685553-1" id="ref7685553-1">[1]</a></div><div class="footnotes"><div class="footnote" id="ft7685553-1"><a class="footnoterefnum" href="#ref7685553-1">[1]</a><div class="ftpara">Editor's Note: This article was signed into law 11-22-1992.</div></div></div></div>                </article>
      </div>
  </div>

